This dataset includes data from subjects who consented to data sharing. 
Full description can be found in:
"Brain Functional Connectivity and Anatomical Features as Predictors of Cognitive Behavioral Therapy Outcome for Anxiety in Youths".
Please note that some of this data might overlap with other data releases from the same research group.
The details of the acquisition are described in the paper and in the json files. 
If using this dataset please cite the manuscript.
Zugman A, Ringlein GV, Finn ES, et al. 
"Brain functional connectivity and anatomical features as predictors of cognitive behavioral therapy 
outcome for anxiety in youths." 
Psychological Medicine. 2025;55:e91. 
doi:10.1017/S0033291724003131 